<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isHostedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/Sensor> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isHostedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://w3.org/ns/sosa/Platform> .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isHostedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relation between a Sensor, or Actuator, Sampler, or Platform, and the Platform that it is mounted on or hosted by."@en .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/isHostedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is hosted by"@en .
# 
