<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Feature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#SpatialObject> .
<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Feature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Esta clase representa una característica de alto nivel, equivalente a GFI_Feature definida en ISP 19156 y es una supercale para todos los tipos de características espaciales."@en .
<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Feature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This class represents the top-level feature type. This\n\tclass is equivalent to GFI_Feature defined in ISO 19156, and it is superclass of\n\tall feature types."@en .
<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Feature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#> .
